A\" x=\"0\" y=\"39\"></use>\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"500\" height=\"60\" x=\"833\" y=\"780\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"833\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"3446\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"3836\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"4225\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"4948\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(5949,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-221A\" x=\"0\" y=\"39\"></use>\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"500\" height=\"60\" x=\"833\" y=\"780\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"833\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"7283\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,-5120)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"7792\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(2367,681)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"722\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1723,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-221A\" x=\"0\" y=\"39\"></use>\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"500\" height=\"60\" x=\"833\" y=\"780\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"833\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-920)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"389\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"1112\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2112,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-221A\" x=\"0\" y=\"39\"></use>\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"500\" height=\"60\" x=\"833\" y=\"780\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"833\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"3446\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"3836\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"4225\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"4948\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(5949,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-221A\" x=\"0\" y=\"39\"></use>\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"500\" height=\"60\" x=\"833\" y=\"780\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"833\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"7283\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(8022,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(0,5446)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"277\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,1984)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"277\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Now, we recall the difference of squares formula:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"24.029ex\" height=\"3.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 10345.7 1367.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n(a+b)(a-b) = a^2 - b^2\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMATHI-61\" d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0 417 -8Q409 -10 393 -10Q359 -10 336 5T306 36L300 51Q299 52 296 50Q294 48 292 46Q233 -10 172 -10Q117 -10 75 30T33 157ZM351 328Q351 334 346 350T323 385T277 405Q242 405 210 374T160 293Q131 214 119 129Q119 126 119 118T118 106Q118 61 136 44T179 26Q217 26 254 59T298 110Q300 114 325 217T351 328Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-2B\" d=\"M56 237T56 250T70 270H369V420L370 570Q380 583 389 583Q402 583 409 568V270H707Q722 262 722 250T707 230H409V-68Q401 -82 391 -82H389H387Q375 -82 369 -68V230H70Q56 237 56 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMATHI-62\" d=\"M73 647Q73 657 77 670T89 683Q90 683 161 688T234 694Q246 694 246 685T212 542Q204 508 195 472T180 418L176 399Q176 396 182 402Q231 442 283 442Q345 442 383 396T422 280Q422 169 343 79T173 -11Q123 -11 82 27T40 150V159Q40 180 48 217T97 414Q147 611 147 623T109 637Q104 637 101 637H96Q86 637 83 637T76 640T73 647ZM336 325V331Q336 405 275 405Q258 405 240 397T207 376T181 352T163 330L157 322L136 236Q114 150 114 114Q114 66 138 42Q154 26 178 26Q211 26 245 58Q270 81 285 114T318 219Q336 291 336 325Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-2212\" d=\"M84 237T84 250T98 270H679Q694 262 694 250T679 230H98Q84 237 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"389\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"1141\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"2141\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"2571\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"2960\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"3350\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"4102\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"5102\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"5532\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"6199\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(7255,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"748\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"8461\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(9462,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"607\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Applying the difference of squares formula with <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"13.719ex\" height=\"3.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 5906.8 1295.7\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">a=1, b=\\sqrt 2</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMATHI-61\" d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0 417 -8